' yes, the specialist equipment shop in the exchange is still operating.
' if you are looking for a high-grade focusing crystal, the owner may have one.
' specialized weapon components are rare, so expect them to be expensive.
~
#ENDPROG

#MUDPROG
Progtype  speech_prog~
Arglist   give~
Comlist   chuckle 
' yes, I once gave a high-grade focusing crystal to a young trainee.
' the trainee showed considerable technical promise, but family circumstances
' forced a return home before the course was completed.
~
#ENDPROG

#MUDPROG
Progtype  speech_prog~
Arglist   crystal focusing~
Comlist   nod $n 
' High-grade focusing crystals are used in several precision energy systems.
' The best specimens are difficult to produce and correspondingly rare.
' I have handled only a few of exceptional quality.
~
#ENDPROG

#MUDPROG
Progtype  act_prog~
Arglist   package.~
Comlist   if ovnuminv(10208) >= 1
say Thank you.
mpwithdraw 2500
give 2500 credits $n
mpgain $n 5 100000
else
say hmm... Thanks, but this isn't adressed to me.
drop all
endif
mpat 10299 drop all
mpat 10299 mppurge
~
#ENDPROG

